{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-outnabout-atp-ltd-nipper-v6-buggy-2606-0149","content_id":"abe2eb8e-a03f-475a-a350-295885e0eab2","description":"Product Safety Report for Out'n'About ATP Ltd Nipper V6 Buggy presenting a risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"ea22fbff-8fde-4b8a-b219-9fc9a44b8cd6","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-14T14:33:16+01:00","id":"ea22fbff-8fde-4b8a-b219-9fc9a44b8cd6","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-14T14:33:16+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7f191c3be22055c1aaa35e/2606-0149-product-safety-report-outnabout-buggy.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Out’n’About ATP Ltd Nipper V6 Buggy</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The specified batches of this product may have a welding defect. This could cause the product to fold unexpectedly during use, potentially injuring the occupant.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Modification programme.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Pram/Pushchair/Stroller Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Out’n’About ATP Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batches</td>\n      <td>P-250119, P-250120, P-250066, P-250067, P-250068</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>All-terrain 3-wheel single and double pushchair. The batch number can be found on the main frame underneath the seat unit, accessible via the basket.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_ea22fbff-8fde-4b8a-b219-9fc9a44b8cd6\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7f191c3be22055c1aaa35e/2606-0149-product-safety-report-outnabout-buggy.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The specified batches of this product may have a welding defect. This could cause the product to fold unexpectedly during use, potentially injuring the occupant.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The manufacturer has initiated a modification programme.</p>\n\n<p>Customers with an affected product should stop using it and submit a form via: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://outnabout.com/pages/inspection-repair-programme\">Inspection &amp; Repair Programme - Out n About</a> to register for an inspection and repair.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please contact    <a href=\"mailto:inspection@outnabout.com\">inspection@outnabout.com</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2606-0149</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-14T13:34:05Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-14","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-14T14:34:05+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product